+/// stable bundle as `.stable` (not `.alpha`), and the stable GitHub rule must
+/// never reach a nightly or a maintainer preview install.
+///
+/// Identities below were read off the real packages on 2026-10-14 (extracted
+/// arm64 zips, `PlistBuddy`): CFBundleName / CFBundleShortVersionString, with
+/// CFBundleVersion identical to the short version on every one of them.
